  "summary": "This study evaluates the effectiveness of preference supervision in language models, introducing Symbolic Preference Labeling and exploring its ability to inspect and verify preference judgments, while also addressing the challenges of distributional shifts in preference optimization. The research highlights the importance of reproducibility in preference construction.",
